  "description": "Appearing in a film by the talented director Hyeon Jung-Hui is every actor's dream. Yeon-Woo, a longtime fan, gets a chance to audition for Jung-Hui's new film by accident. But the audition was actually a setup by the casting director to offer Jung-Hui sexual favors. Unaware of this, Yeon-Woo, hearing Jung-Hui's mocking words telling him to seduce him, naturally assumes it's acting and obediently climbs on top...\n\n *“What? You didn't prepare? You want me to undo your belt too?”*\n\nA romance where a prickly older man peels away layer after layer of a cheeky young man's charm. \n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
